      Patch 1: patch1       ┃      Patch 2: patch2
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Patch mode: comparisons use only the source lines quoted
in the patches.

═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
*    DELTA DIFFERENCES                                  *
═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
Signs mark edits made by only that patch. A sign-less
line with one number is an edit both patches make: a new
number means both add it, an old number means both remove
it.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
 old new│f.c                ┃ old new│f.c
        │@@                 ┃        │@@ int crlf_top(voi
        │                   ┃        │d)
   1   1│	c1          ┃   1   1│	c1
   2   2│	a_zulu      ┃-  2    │	a_old
        │                   ┃+      2│	a_p2
   3   3│	c2          ┃   3   3│	c2
   4   4│int crlf_mid(void) ┃-  4    │int crlf_mid(void)
   5    │	b_old       ┃   5    │	b_old
        │                   ┃+      4│int crlf_mid(int x)
+      5│	b_p1        ┃+      5│	b_p2
   6   6│	c3          ┃   6   6│	c3
   7   7│	c_zulu      ┃-  7    │	c_old
        │                   ┃+      7│	c_p2
   8   8│	c4          ┃   8   8│	c4

═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
*    CONTEXT DIFFERENCES                                *
═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
Signs mark lines present in only one result: - patch1, +
patch2.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
